{"route":"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/","title":"Data Sources and Collection Methods | Data Foundations Tutorial","description":"Learn where analytical data comes from, how collection choices shape meaning, and why provenance must be documented before analysis.","canonical":"https://datalearninghub.netlify.app/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/","bodyAttrs":{"data-page":"tutorial-chapter","data-tutorial":"data-foundations","data-chapter":"data-sources-and-collection"},"mainHtml":"<main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"tutorial-layout\">\n<aside class=\"tutorial-sidebar\" id=\"tutorial-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-head\">\n<a class=\"tutorial-course-title\" data-bn=\"ডেটা ফাউন্ডেশন\" data-en=\"Data Foundations\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/\">Data Foundations</a>\n<button aria-label=\"Close chapter menu\" class=\"icon-button tutorial-drawer-close\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-close\" type=\"button\">×</button>\n</div>\n<label class=\"tutorial-sidebar-search\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Search chapters</span><input data-placeholder-bn=\"Chapter খুঁজুন…\" data-placeholder-en=\"Search chapters…\" id=\"tutorial-chapter-search\" placeholder=\"Search chapters…\" type=\"search\"/></label>\n<div class=\"tutorial-progress-mini\"><div><span data-bn=\"Course progress\" data-en=\"Course progress\">Course progress</span><strong id=\"tutorial-progress-label\">0/21</strong></div><div class=\"progress-track\"><span id=\"tutorial-progress-bar\" style=\"width:0\"></span></div></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"Course chapters\" class=\"tutorial-chapter-nav\"><div class=\"tutorial-module-links\"><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"welcome-to-data-analytics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/welcome-to-data-analytics/\"><span>01</span><span data-bn=\"ডেটা অ্যানালিটিক্সে স্বাগতম\" data-en=\"Welcome to Data Analytics\">Welcome to Data Analytics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b>