a-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-structures-and-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><span>08</span><span data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link current\" data-chapter-link=\"data-sources-and-collection\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><span>09</span><span data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><span>10</span><span data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"sampling-methods\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><span>11</span><span data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><span>12</span><span data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"data-sources-and-collection\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 9 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 9 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 9 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Analytical data কোথা থেকে আসে, collection choice meaning-কে কীভাবে shape করে এবং analysis-এর আগে provenance কেন document করতে হয় তা শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Learn where analytical data comes from, how collection choices shape meaning, and why provenance must be documented before analysis.\">Learn where analytical data comes from, how collection choices shape meaning, and why provenance must be documented before analysis.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 45 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Primary ও secondary data আলাদা করুন।\" data-en=\"Distinguish primary and secondary data.\">Distinguish primary and secondary data.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Common collection method চিনুন।\" data-en=\"Recognize common collection methods.\">Recognize common collection methods.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Fitness for purpose evaluate করুন।\" data-en=\"Evaluate fitness for purpose.\">Evaluate fitness for purpose.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Provenance ও collection limitation document করুন।\" data-en=\"Document provenance and collection limitations.\">Document provenance and collection limitations.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Primary ও secondary data\" data-en=\"Primary and secondary data\">Primary and secondary data</h2><p data-bn=\"Primary data current purpose-এর জন্য directly collect করা হয়, যেমন designed survey বা experiment। Secondary data আগে অন্য operational, administrative বা research purpose-এ collect হয়েছে। Valuable হলেও definition ও coverage নতুন question-এর সঙ্গে match নাও করতে পারে।\" data-en=\"Primary data are collected directly for the current purpose, such as a designed survey or experiment. Secondary data already exist because they were collected for another operational, administrative, or research purpose. Secondary data can be valuable, but definitions and coverage may not match the new question.\">Primary data are collected directly for the current purpose, such as a designed survey or experiment. Secondary data already exist because they were collected for another operational, administrative, or research purpose. Secondary data can be valuable, but definitions and coverage may not match the new question.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Collection method\" data-en=\"Collection methods\">Collection methods</h2><p data-bn=\"Common method: survey, interview, observation, experiment, sensor, transaction, application log, form ও administrative system। প্রতিটি method-এর error আলাদা: nonresponse, sensor drift, invalid form entry বা consented/completed user-এ সীমিত log।\" data-en=\"Common methods include surveys, interviews, observation, experiments, sensors, transactions, application logs, forms, and administrative systems. Each method has different errors: people may not respond, sensors may drift, forms may allow invalid entries, and logs may record only users who consented or completed an action.\">Common methods include surveys, interviews, observation, experiments, sensors, transactions, application logs, forms, and administrative systems. Each method has different errors: people may not respond, sensors may drift, forms may allow invalid entries, and logs may record only users who consented or completed an action.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Fitness for purpose\" data-en=\"Fitness for purpose\">Fitness for purpose</h2><p data-bn=\"Data একটি question-এর তুলনায় useful। Coverage, time period, unit, definition, granularity, update process, missing group, access condition ও legal/ethical limit check করুন। “Large” data unrepresentative বা irrelevant হতে পারে।\" data-en=\"Data are useful only relative to a question. Check who or what is covered, time period, unit, definitions, granularity, update process, missing groups, access conditions, and legal or ethical limits. “Large” data can still be unrepresentative or irrelevant.\">Data are useful only relative to a question. Check who or what is covered, time period, unit, definitions, granularity, update process, missing groups, access conditions, and legal or ethical limits. “Large” data can still be unrepresentative or irrelevant.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-4\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">04</div><h2 data-bn=\"Provenance\" data-en=\"Provenance\">Provenance</h2><p data-bn=\"Provenance record করে data কোথা থেকে, কে collect/transform করেছে, কখন, কোন rule-এ এবং কী change হয়েছে। Provenance ছাড়া result reproduce বা dataset appropriate কি না judge করা কঠিন।\" data-en=\"Provenance records where data came from, who collected or transformed it, when, under which rules, and what changed. Without provenance, analysts cannot reproduce results or judge whether a dataset is appropriate.\">Provenance records where data came from, who collected or transformed it, when, under which rules, and what changed. Without provenance, analysts cannot reproduce results or judge whether a dataset is appropriate.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Primary data\" data-en=\"Primary data\">Primary data</h3><p data-bn=\"Current investigation-এর জন্য specifically collected data।\" data-en=\"Data collected specifically for the current investigation.\">Data collected specifically for the current investigation.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Secondary data\" data-en=\"Secondary data\">Secondary data</h3><p data-bn=\"নতুন purpose-এ reused existing data।\" data-en=\"Existing data reused for a new purpose.\">Existing data reused for a new purpose.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Provenance\" data-en=\"Provenance\">Provenance</h3><p data-bn=\"Data-এর documented origin ও processing history।\" data-en=\"The documented origin and processing history of data.\">The documented origin and processing history of data.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Coverage\" data-en=\"Coverage\">Coverage</h3><p data-bn=\"Source-এ represented people, event, place ও period।\" data-en=\"The people, events, places, and periods represented by a source.\">The people, events, places, and periods represented by a source.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"School attendance study-এর data\" data-en=\"Choosing data for a school attendance study\">Choosing data for a school attendance study</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"Question: transport disruption দুই school center-এর attendance কমিয়েছে কি না।\" data-en=\"The question is whether transport disruption reduced attendance in two school centers.\">The question is whether transport disruption reduced attendance in two school centers.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"Attendance register secondary administrative data।\" data-en=\"Attendance registers are secondary administrative data.\">Attendance registers are secondary administrative data.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"Transport disruption date external record থেকে আসতে পারে।\" data-en=\"Transport disruption dates may come from external records.\">Transport disruption dates may come from external records.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"দুই center-এ attendance consistently record হয়েছে কি না check করুন।\" data-en=\"Check whether attendance was recorded consistently in both centers.\">Check whether attendance was recorded consistently in both centers.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Absence-এ date ও student identifier আছে কি না confirm করুন।\" data-en=\"Confirm that absences have dates and student identifiers.\">Confirm that absences have dates and student identifiers.</p></li><li><span>5</span><p data-bn=\"Holiday ও center closure competing explanation হিসেবে document করুন।\" data-en=\"Document holidays and center closures as competing explanations.\">Document holidays and center closures as competing explanations.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Date, coverage ও recording rule sufficiently consistent হলে source question support করতে পারে।\" data-en=\"The source can support the question only if dates, coverage, and recording rules are sufficiently consistent.\">The source can support the question only if dates, coverage, and recording rules are sufficiently consistent.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Collection method meaning ও error affect করে।\" data-en=\"Collection method affects meaning and error.\">Collection method affects meaning and error.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Secondary data নতুন purpose-এর সঙ্গে check করতে হয়।\" data-en=\"Secondary data must be checked against the new purpose.\">Secondary data must be checked against the new purpose.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Provenance trust ও reproducibility support করে।\" data-en=\"Provenance supports trust and reproducibility.\">Provenance supports trust and reproducibility.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"More data automatically better data নয়।\" data-en=\"More data is not automatically better data.\">More data is not automatically better data.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/SpecialPublications/1500-18/NIST.SP.1500-18r2.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST Research Data Framework ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://ukdataservice.ac.uk/help/new-users/data-documentation/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">UK Data Service — Data Documentation ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.census.gov/topics/research/stat-research/expertise/survey-sampling.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">U.S. Census Bureau — Survey Sampling ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}